WEBVTT

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:07.700
You've come to?

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.040
Annette...

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:10.700
How's Sven?

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:12.710
His injuries aren't serious.

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:17.540
But... it looks like
he's taking this pretty hard.

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:21.740
Princess!

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:28.390
<i>That's how it always starts...</i>
<i>under the azure sky</i>

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:35.290
<i>After making a vow,</i>
<i>I now set off</i>

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:54.680
<i>Yeah, the desert glitters with a golden hue</i>
<i>(The wind is scorching)</i>

00:00:54.680 --> 00:01:01.020
<i>I'm searching for a diamond flower</i>
<i>(I keep on wandering)</i>

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:07.360
<i>Now, for the first time in my life,</i>

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:13.700
<i>I live for someone else</i>

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:20.210
<i>There's something</i>
<i>I wanna protect</i>

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:26.210
<i>I'll never,</i>
<i>ever lose it again</i>

00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:29.720
<i>Resound,</i>
<i>my heartbeat!</i>

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:39.710
<i>A heartbeat smaller and fragile,</i>
<i>but tougher than anyone's.</i>

00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:56.270
"Cat Sharpens His Claws"

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:18.690
Eve, your journey that began in a tank
at Bioberg has come to an end.

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:24.030
The life of people, the joys and sorrows...
the wisdom to live, and battle...

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:28.370
You have obtained all
the knowledge you require.

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:30.040
Rejoice!

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:34.040
You have been given the right
to live in paradise.

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:37.380
Pa... ra... dise...

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:41.050
Yes, the paradise called Eden.

00:02:41.050 --> 00:02:43.680
E... den...

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:57.730
From this moment, you will
become one with Eden!

00:02:57.730 --> 00:03:01.000
And you will live in paradise for eternity!

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.560
Magnificent!

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:20.020
Eve!

00:03:28.360 --> 00:03:30.370
You're going to get Eve back?

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:31.700
Of course!

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:33.700
You don't even know where she is...

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:35.370
and in that condition, what can you do!?

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:37.710
You expect me to lie still in bed!?

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:41.380
How can I!? Eve's been kidnapped!

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:43.900
If I don't save her, who will!?

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:49.050
Don't act like no one else cares but you!

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:52.680
Even to me, princess is
a precious comrade!

00:03:55.730 --> 00:04:00.060
Remember, you once punched me?

00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:02.330
I seem to recall something like that.

00:04:02.330 --> 00:04:04.670
You said so yourself...

00:04:04.670 --> 00:04:08.670
to rely on your comrades more.

00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:12.010
So leave the rest to me.

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:14.910
You sure talk cool!

00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:19.680
Annette is checking on
Mason's movements right now.

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:21.350
That old man?

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:24.020
Mason was the oldest member of Chronos,

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:27.360
and the only member of the Numbers
to experience the Itairiku War.

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:29.690
Sephiria depended on him a lot, too.

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:31.690
But why would someone like him...

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:37.700
The problem is that Mason
is the one who took Eve.

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:41.040
Anyway, take it easy and recover.

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:43.040
Hey! Where are you going!?

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:45.370
Mason is quite a schemer.

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:48.040
I've gotta be prepared for him.

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:50.380
Drink that and heal quickly.

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:51.750
Be seeing you!

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:57.620
Is this his only way of showing kindness?

00:05:01.990 --> 00:05:05.330
The three elders have been assassinated.

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:07.000
As I expected...

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:09.000
I see it was Mason's doing?

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:12.000
We were totally had.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:15.000
The branches around the world
are in a state of turmoil.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:17.670
A plot 20 years in the making...

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:22.010
When we faced Mason,
he used Tao techniques.

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:24.350
When did he gain such power?

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:26.020
Probably in the Itairiku War...

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:30.020
So he made an alliance
with Taoists back then.

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:32.020
Nanotech and Tao...

00:05:32.020 --> 00:05:34.360
This is quite a problem.

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:37.360
Ultimate peace...
he said something like that...

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:41.030
That's sheer nonsense.
We must stop them at all cost.

00:05:41.030 --> 00:05:46.700
But Sephiria... do we have the power
at this time, to confront Mason?

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:52.710
The reality is that world governments are
calling to cancel their financial support.

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:56.440
Still, we must do it.

00:05:58.050 --> 00:06:00.320
What a creepy moon.

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:02.650
It's an ominous color.

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:05.320
Where're you guys headed from here?

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:08.320
I'm taking off for a while. I'm exhausted.

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:11.330
I have work.

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:14.660
So we're all going our separate ways.

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:16.000
Wanna come with me?

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:19.000
If you're by yourself, you get lost
even in your own room, don't you?

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:21.000
What!? D- don't insult me!

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:23.630
I was at least able to find
my way back from the john!

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:46.630
Smooch, smooch, smooch... Kuro-<i>sama...</i>

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:58.870
I guess no one's here anymore...

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:03.650
Who's there?

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:05.650
Quit standing there like a stick!

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:09.320
If this were a real bullet, you'd be dead!

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:10.840
Tim...

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:13.910
Leon...

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.860
Layla...

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:27.530
We thought you were dead, Leon!

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:34.170
Welcome home, Leon.

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:40.580
It's good to be back.

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:56.030
No data at all on those Zero Numbers?

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:58.370
Like the number says... zero.

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:00.040
Any word from Train?

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:03.310
He just left!

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:07.980
Hey... What's the use of sitting there
and punching away at the keyboard!?

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:09.650
Shut up!

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:13.310
I'm contacting the information brokers and
the sweepers around the country right now!

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:18.010
I'll go walking for rehabilitation.

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:24.090
Sven?

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:26.660
R- Rins!?

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:28.330
You're alive?

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:31.330
Well, I saw the netherworld
for a second just now...

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:33.670
Never mind that. What're you doing here?

00:08:33.670 --> 00:08:36.010
I heard about Eve from Annette.

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:39.340
So I brought someone
who may have some leads.

00:08:39.340 --> 00:08:41.000
Leads?

00:08:45.010 --> 00:08:47.020
Sh- she's...

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:48.680
Eve!

00:08:48.680 --> 00:08:50.690
Tearju Lunatique.

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:52.880
Eve's creator.

00:08:54.020 --> 00:08:55.690
Amnesia?

00:08:55.690 --> 00:08:58.360
Then she can't give us any leads!

00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:00.960
But I'm sure she knows something.

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:03.970
That may be so, but...

00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:07.970
In any case, they really look alike!
Are they blood-related?

00:09:07.970 --> 00:09:10.310
I'm almost positive Eve's her clone.

00:09:10.310 --> 00:09:12.640
Clone!? Hey!

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:17.980
Tearju is one of the top scientists not only
in nanomachines but also in clone science.

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:22.990
In other words, she was
experimenting on her own clone?

00:09:22.990 --> 00:09:24.990
What was she thinking!?

00:09:24.990 --> 00:09:27.860
Scientists live in a different world.

00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:31.330
Rins, give me your cell phone!

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:31.990
Huh!?

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:34.000
You took Eve's picture
with it before, didn't you?

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:35.000
So?

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:38.000
If we show it to her,
it may jog her memory!

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:41.000
Hey, you're right!

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:44.010
Here it is. This is Eve.

00:09:44.010 --> 00:09:46.010
E... ve?

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:48.810
Well? You recognize her, don't you?

00:09:51.010 --> 00:09:52.480
Tearju?

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:10.030
Eve!

00:10:10.030 --> 00:10:11.700
Hey lady, calm down!

00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:14.040
Eve! I must stop Eve!

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:16.040
What? Do what to Eve!?

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:18.370
Eve! Turn back to dust!

00:10:18.370 --> 00:10:20.100
Eve!

00:10:24.710 --> 00:10:26.840
--Tearju!
--Tearju!

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:02.940
You're awake, Eve?

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:07.360
Where am I?

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:11.360
Eden... the paradise
at the center of the world.

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:13.700
Who are you?

00:11:13.700 --> 00:11:18.070
I'm Adam. I've been waiting
for you a long time.

00:11:26.710 --> 00:11:32.050
I was lonely all by myself,
so I'm really happy that you've come.

00:11:32.050 --> 00:11:35.380
I... can't remember anything.

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:38.050
You don't have to remember anything.

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:41.020
You have been reborn, so...

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:45.150
Reborn?

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:49.060
Anxiety doesn't suit Eden.

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:51.530
Now smile!

00:11:56.410 --> 00:12:00.680
There is no fighting... no illness...
no unhappiness in Eden.

00:12:00.680 --> 00:12:03.410
Even food can be... Look...

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:09.350
Like this, we can eat
all we want whenever we want.

00:12:09.350 --> 00:12:11.980
There's no hunger here either.

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:15.690
An apple...

00:12:15.690 --> 00:12:17.920
Take a bite.

00:12:23.370 --> 00:12:25.370
Hypnotized yourself?

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:28.370
to react when you see Eve's face?

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:30.600
That's why you reacted
in front of the mirror...

00:12:32.370 --> 00:12:35.040
Why'd you do such a thing?

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:37.380
I didn't want them to use me...

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:38.050
Huh?

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:41.050
Or my research... or Eve.

00:12:41.050 --> 00:12:45.390
That's why when Torneo attacked
the research lab at Bioberg...

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:48.390
I tried to destroy everything.

00:12:48.390 --> 00:12:50.390
But I didn't have enough time.

00:12:50.390 --> 00:12:53.730
Kanzaki, my assistant, was already
in cahoots with Mason, so...

00:12:53.730 --> 00:12:55.060
Kanzaki?

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:58.730
At the lab, we called him Doctor.

00:12:58.730 --> 00:13:00.340
It's this man.

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:01.670
That's-

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:03.010
He may not look it,

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:05.670
but he was an ambitious man
who was determined to take my place.

00:13:05.670 --> 00:13:10.350
And he fell victim to his ambition
and was ensnared by Mason.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:15.020
I can't forgive him! He stole the research
that I poured my heart and soul into!

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:16.350
Now, now...

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:21.360
So tell us, what was
this research of yours about?

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:23.360
It was the Eden Project, wasn't it?

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:25.690
What is that?

00:13:25.690 --> 00:13:30.030
A frightening plan... to bring about
ultimate peace to the world.

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:33.370
Peace? Nothing wrong with peace.

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:36.710
Even if humans stop being humans?

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:39.240
Infect people with nanomachines

00:13:39.240 --> 00:13:41.710
and centrally control them
using the power of Tao.

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:44.710
That is the outline of the Eden Project.

00:13:44.710 --> 00:13:47.720
Well, that certainly would
put an end to wars...

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:50.390
But that's quite an outrageous plan.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:53.390
But what does Eve have to do with it?

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:55.390
Eve will activate Eden.

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:56.390
Eden?

00:13:56.390 --> 00:14:00.060
The mechanical living form
which I invented.

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:03.670
Once activated, it will spread
nanomachines throughout the world...

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:05.670
and control the people of the world...

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:08.240
And using their life energy
as the driving force...

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:09.670
its life will become immortal.

00:14:09.670 --> 00:14:12.010
And you're saying that Eve
will be the pilot for this?

00:14:12.010 --> 00:14:13.340
Yes...

00:14:13.340 --> 00:14:16.680
Eve will be set in the center of Eden.

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:21.020
Eve was developed to serve
as Eden's consciousness.

00:14:21.020 --> 00:14:25.690
Her role as a "bio-weapon" was just a ruse.

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:28.020
That's why I must destroy Eve!

00:14:28.020 --> 00:14:30.030
Before Eden is activated!

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:32.690
That is my duty as her creator!

00:14:32.690 --> 00:14:34.700
Don't be so selfish!!

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:37.370
She may be a clone or whatever,
but... Eve is Eve!!

00:14:37.370 --> 00:14:40.560
You think I'd let you erase her
just to suit your whims!!

00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:44.710
Tearju...

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:48.380
I want to save Eve, too.

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:53.280
But if Eden is activated,
it will mean the end of this world.

00:14:55.380 --> 00:14:58.390
Hasn't Eden been activated yet?

00:14:58.390 --> 00:15:02.320
Eden's operation circuit is
trying to link up with Eve.

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:04.490
Once that is complete...

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:09.320
Aren't you going to eat? It's good.

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:15.000
It tastes wonderful... something you've
never tasted before in your life.

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:18.010
Now, hurry...

00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:21.010
What will happen when Eden is activated?

00:15:21.010 --> 00:15:23.680
Eden will cover the sky and make it rain.

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:25.010
Rain?

00:15:25.010 --> 00:15:27.020
Nanomachine rain.

00:15:27.020 --> 00:15:30.690
It will seep into humans...
and cause a transformation.

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:34.360
Even I don't know what the result will be.

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:36.690
Can't we tell Eve not to do that?

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:39.360
The Eve that you know will be erased...

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:42.030
and she'll become one with Eden.

00:15:42.030 --> 00:15:45.370
She probably won't
remember anyone by that time.

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:47.700
That's ridiculous!

00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:51.040
Eve will become Eden's consciousness.

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:57.380
Only after that happens, Eden will be
able to recognize and control humans.

00:15:57.380 --> 00:16:01.040
So Eve will no longer be Eve...

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:06.660
A giant nebula which
has absorbed all humans...

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:11.330
Some people may call it god.

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:14.660
Or... demon...

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:17.670
Eat it.

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:20.830
Eat... this...

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:35.350
That's wonderful, Eve.

00:16:35.350 --> 00:16:38.020
You will nurture paradise...

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:40.690
and paradise will continue to grow...

00:16:40.690 --> 00:16:44.520
and soon cover everything on this planet!

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:50.370
Ohhhh!

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:52.700
The moment has arrived!

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:56.260
The day I have waited for... for so long!

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:01.340
Creed...

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:04.340
Creed!

00:17:15.660 --> 00:17:17.660
Oops, I drank too much again.

00:17:17.660 --> 00:17:21.000
We had drinks... at the
wedding party... for a toast.

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:22.560
Huh?

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:26.670
Oh, the sunset?

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:28.340
How pretty!

00:17:28.340 --> 00:17:32.070
But why a sunset in broad daylight?

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:35.680
Pretty...

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:37.680
Yeah...

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:40.050
The cloud is spreading in this direction...

00:17:41.350 --> 00:17:43.690
So Mason is on the move now...

00:17:43.690 --> 00:17:47.690
The location is the desert
in the northwest... near Kashmir City.

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:50.030
Just what is he up to?

00:17:50.030 --> 00:17:52.030
That is not our concern.

00:17:52.030 --> 00:17:54.030
Order an attack immediately.

00:17:54.030 --> 00:17:57.700
The communication with our
Kashmir branch has been lost.

00:17:57.700 --> 00:18:01.300
So nothing is left on our side...

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:02.640
Even if it's just us alone!

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:06.100
With just the few of us,
we cannot hope for victory.

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:10.310
Hey, hey... why so depressed?

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:14.650
I really don't want to
see you guys despondent.

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:16.550
Heartnet!

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:21.320
And you still call yourselves Numbers?

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:25.330
You're going to take
old Mason's antics lying down?

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:28.330
Since you left Chronos,
it's none of your business.

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:32.000
Or... will you return to Chronos?

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:34.000
Eve was kidnapped by Mason.

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:37.010
Eve? That bio-weapon?

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:39.170
Eve is my comrade!

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:42.010
What do you expect us to do?

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:45.010
It's simple. I'm gonna rescue Eve.

00:18:45.010 --> 00:18:47.680
You're coming too, right?

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:49.680
Whatever happened to the Numbers' pride?

00:18:49.680 --> 00:18:52.050
That insufferable pride!?

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:57.050
All right.

00:18:58.030 --> 00:19:03.760
Just this one time... We Chronos
will lend you a hand, Heartnet!

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:06.960
Now that's more like it!

00:19:13.640 --> 00:19:16.610
Oh!? What's going on?

00:19:17.980 --> 00:19:20.140
Oh, it's rain.

00:19:25.650 --> 00:19:28.850
Peace... peace is coming.

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:34.660
Huh? Maybe I drank too much?

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:35.760
Oh?

00:19:38.330 --> 00:19:40.340
Oh, yeah! It's begun!

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:42.340
--Hey, sit down! I can't see!
--Go!

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:43.910
I know I'm getting too old for this,

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:46.680
--but I always get excited
when I see something like this.
--Now! Dead blow beam!

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:49.440
--Hey, I've seen this program before.
--Ahhhh!

00:19:51.680 --> 00:19:53.010
--We interrupt this program
for important news.
--What!?

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:56.020
--Kashmir City in the
northwestern region of the continent
--No!

00:19:56.020 --> 00:19:58.350
is under attack
from a strange flying object.

00:19:58.350 --> 00:20:01.980
We will bring you more news
as it becomes available.

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:09.360
Say, what'll you order?
I'm having a fruit parfait.

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:10.370
Sweet bean soup for me.

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:11.700
Grilled octopus in batter for me!

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:13.370
A sweet shop wouldn't have that, you know!

00:20:13.370 --> 00:20:15.040
Oh, really?

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:19.040
Oh? What's wrong, Kyoko?

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:21.380
Hey, Kyoko!

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:23.080
--Kashmir...
--Hey what's that?

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:26.140
--that's the city
where I dated Little Kuro-<i>sama</i>!?
--Oh... I'm scared!

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:32.880
Splendid...

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:39.730
Look! Man has abandoned his ego
and become one!

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:42.400
This is indeed Utopia!

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:45.400
Now we will absorb people into Eden.

00:20:45.400 --> 00:20:48.070
They will become
the flesh and blood of Eden,

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:52.230
and become the source of Tao power.

00:21:02.020 --> 00:21:03.450
What is this!?

00:21:09.360 --> 00:21:14.030
Tearju, you really created
something terrible.

00:21:14.030 --> 00:21:17.030
People are being sucked in!

00:21:17.030 --> 00:21:21.700
It seems it's designed not only to merge
human minds, but their bodies as well.

00:21:21.700 --> 00:21:24.710
Designed!? Can't you do something!?

00:21:24.710 --> 00:21:27.040
As the one responsible for its development,

00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:28.710
I will take responsibility
until the very end.

00:21:28.710 --> 00:21:30.650
But how?

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:35.050
Oh! Is it over for mankind!?

00:21:35.050 --> 00:21:36.720
Quit your whining!

00:21:36.720 --> 00:21:39.050
I'm sorry... Huh?

00:21:39.050 --> 00:21:40.060
Bro!

00:21:40.060 --> 00:21:42.060
Yo! Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:21:42.060 --> 00:21:44.790
Train, you're so late!

00:21:53.740 --> 00:21:55.740
These guys are pretty dependable,
wouldn't you say?

00:21:55.740 --> 00:21:58.410
Huh? Yeah...

00:21:58.410 --> 00:22:00.340
Awright! Let's go, Sven!

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:02.870
Princess must be tired of waiting!

00:22:14.350 --> 00:22:21.360
<i>Since your new black boots</i>
<i>caused a blister,</i>

00:22:21.360 --> 00:22:28.370
<i>you rest your right foot</i>

00:22:28.370 --> 00:22:38.370
<i>We'll keep walking along</i>
<i>with our own rhythm, without rushing</i>

00:22:41.880 --> 00:22:51.880
<i>Don't say anything</i>
<i>because we'll soon understand each other</i>

00:22:56.430 --> 00:23:06.430
<i>I'm just holding you now to keep you warm</i>

00:23:10.680 --> 00:23:20.680
<i>I'm completely wrapped around you, so...</i>

00:23:21.090 --> 00:23:31.090
<i>Quietly the powder-like snow</i>
<i>is building up...</i>

00:23:40.510 --> 00:23:41.710
"Next Episode"

00:23:41.710 --> 00:23:43.440
<i>Eve... what are you thinking?</i>
"Next Episode"

00:23:43.440 --> 00:23:44.710
<i>Eve... what are you thinking?</i>

00:23:44.710 --> 00:23:48.710
<i>You're not remembering the past, are you?</i>

00:23:48.710 --> 00:23:52.720
<i>Stop this nonsense.</i>
<i>You are here in paradise now.</i>

00:23:52.720 --> 00:23:58.060
<i>Look at this peaceful scenery</i>
<i>filled with happiness.</i>

00:23:58.060 --> 00:24:02.330
<i>If you are still haunted</i>
<i>by the ghosts of the past...</i>

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:02.460
<i>I know a way to deal with that.</i>

00:24:02.460 --> 00:24:04.830
"Cat in Paradise"
<i>I know a way to deal with that.</i>

00:24:04.830 --> 00:24:05.420
"Cat in Paradise"
